        </div>
    </div>
</div><div class="accordion cloneable">
    <h2 class="accordion-title">
    Second Judicial Circuit
    </h2>
    <div class="accordion-content">
        <p>
            <u></u><b><u>Counties:</u></b> Crawford, Edwards, Franklin, Gallatin, Hamilton, Hardin, Jefferson, Lawrence, Richland, Wabash, Wayne, White<br>
        </p>
        <p>
            <b><b></b>Melissa Morgan, Chief Judge<br>
            Jefferson County Justice Center
            </b><br>
            911 Casey Avenue, Suite HI-05
            <br>
            Mt. Vernon, IL 62864
            <br>
            <br>
            Main Office: 618-244-8036
            <br>
            FAX: 618-244-8038
            <br>
        </p>
